{"title":"Scroll Acid Pit","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Bogling, Bog</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      <p><b>Teaches</b> Acid Pit, a level-3 Acid spell. Needs 30 Intellect and Acid skill 15 to learn and to cast.</p><p><b>Drops from monsters that cast Acid spells, level 18+.</b></p><ul class=\"wp-list\">\n          <li>A monster that casts spells drops scrolls of its own school, so look for Acid casters.</li>\n          <li>The monster’s level picks the spell level: <b>8+</b> drops level-2 scrolls, <b>18+</b> level-3 and <b>30+</b> level-4.</li>\n          </ul>\n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"bogling\" title=\"Bogling - Normal, 1.4% of recorded drops (1 / 73 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/40fefc5bf6085eae0053.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bogling</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1.4%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"bog\" title=\"Bog - Normal, 4.2% of recorded drops (1 / 24 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/fe582e27e9d83b3d3f96.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bog</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">4.2%</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Share of logged loot events from this monster, not a per-kill chance.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"scroll-acid-pit\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/36e828d6e26df580a66e.svg\" alt=\"Scroll Acid Pit\"></div><h3>Scroll Acid Pit</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>2 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n 